WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.730
From the corner of this crumbled world,

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:09.900
we gaze up at the sky.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:16.530
I set off in search of your warmth.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:29.000
I reached out my hand, though I had no place to go.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.510
Hiding my loneliness, I fumbled for my way.

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:37.180
On those nights without you,

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:39.850
I felt for the first time

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.690
the pain in my heart.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:50.900
From the corner of this crumbled world,

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:56.070
we gaze up at the sky.

00:00:56.070 --> 00:01:02.290
I set off in search of your warmth.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:12.050
If the feverish heat we shared as I held your hand

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:17.430
shall light a flame that will never go out,

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:23.390
then let's set off together, in search of warmth,

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:32.980
to a brand new world.

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:46.500
<i>It was shortly after Miketsukami-kun and I first started dating.</i>

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.540
Here you go.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:51.380
Th-Thank you.

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:54.380
Oh, Ririchiyo-sama...

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:56.500
That's the stirring stick.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:00.760
D-Don't laugh!

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:03.340
I apologize.

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:06.020
You were so endearing, I could not help it.

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.680
<i>Th-This can't go on.</i>

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:13.030
<i>I'm so nervous that I keep making a fool of myself.</i>

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:15.350
<i>We may be a couple now,</i>

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:18.110
<i>but I feel more self-conscious than ever.</i>

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:22.260
<i>What's more, why is nobody else around?</i>

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:26.800
<i>We're all alone in this enormous room.</i>

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:30.880
<i>I'm a nervous wreck.</i>

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:33.020
<i>I'm acting like I have something to hide.</i>

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:37.920
Ririchiyo-sama?

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:46.830
Ririchiyo-sama, are you nervous?

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:48.570
O-Of course not!

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:51.480
What reason have I to be nervous around <i>you—</i>

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:58.230
Wh-Wh-What was that for?

00:02:58.230 --> 00:03:00.040
Please forgive me.

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:04.840
Seeing your nervousness
arouses my sense of mischief.

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:07.040
I feel impelled to tease you.

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:08.660
Don't.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:14.000
We're all alone, are we not?

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.760
Why don't I make you
feel more comfortable?

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:31.480
Would you feel more at ease with a child?

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:33.730
<i>He...</i>

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:38.730
<i>He's adorable.</i>

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:43.320
What do you think?

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:48.000
W-Well,

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:52.430
it's not like I was nervous to begin with, so this is hardly necessary,

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:54.430
but you <i>are</i> needlessly large.

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:57.070
This size is far more manageable.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.690
I'll grant you that.

00:03:58.690 --> 00:04:01.260
I am honored by your approval.

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:04.510
Ririchiyo-sama, Ririchiyo-sama.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:07.990
Do you love me?

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:10.680
Please say, "Miketsukami-kun, I love you."

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:14.520
Wh-Why do you bring this up?

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:17.190
Do you hate me?

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.780
Of course I love you.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:29.030
Ririchiyo-sama.

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:31.810
Well then, please hold me tighter.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:33.870
Very well.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.420
Please pet me.

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.650
No sooner said than done.

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:40.300
Ririchiyo-sama, Ririchiyo-sama.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:44.500
You're so soft... and you smell so nice.

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:47.360
Not so fast!

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:50.040
You're 22! You're an adult!

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.720
I nearly lost myself there.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:54.400
Why did <i>I</i> end up babying <i>you?</i>

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.980
What is the matter, Ririchiyo-sama?

00:04:57.590 --> 00:04:59.480
That's not going to work anymore!

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:01.730
I don't believe you.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.460
Ever the opportunist, aren't you?

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:06.150
Well it's not happening today.

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:09.210
I see. That's unfortunate.

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:10.530
In that case...

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:16.460
...how about this?

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:20.380
Would it be easier to relax and communicate with someone of the same sex?

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:23.990
Y-You can transform into a woman, too?

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:25.130
Yes.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:29.010
I assure you I'm female, both inside and out.

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:31.650
Would you like to see for yourself?

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:35.210
I am always ready, no matter when or where,

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:39.100
to show you my everything.

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:40.760
No. Spare me.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:43.860
<i>But I must admit,</i>

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:47.000
<i>she—he has a nice figure.</i>

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:50.380
<i>Beautiful, in fact. I feel like the lesser woman.</i>

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:53.620
Ririchiyo-sama, shall we have a lesson?

00:05:53.630 --> 00:05:55.750
A-A lesson?

00:05:56.520 --> 00:06:02.460
Put simply, it's to help you grow accustomed to intimate contact.

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:05.440
What are you—

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:08.050
Dear me, why do your cheeks redden?

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:11.030
It's just us two girls. No need to be shy.

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:13.210
Y-You're in my personal space!

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:14.810
What's the purpose of this, anyway?

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:20.110
As I said, we are practicing so that you don't feel nervous anymore.

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:22.950
Our relationship has just barely begun.

00:06:22.950 --> 00:06:26.070
You can expect a <i>lot</i> more in the future.

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:31.820
I thought we might ease into it, so you don't feel scared.

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:33.950
E-Ease into...?

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:38.050
If this is how you react to me now,

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:41.880
I can only imagine how you'll be when I transform back.

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:44.460
Ah, but that only arouses me more.

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:46.710
Don't put it so lewdly!

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:52.630
I'm merely fulfilling my role as your faithful servant and lover

00:06:52.630 --> 00:06:57.530
by trying to reduce your mental stress.

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:02.030
Man, I'm sleepy.

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:06.590
Are you <i>ever</i> alert?

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:16.450
M...

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:19.960
MANIAC!

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:37.040
Hmm...

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.680
I'm super bored...

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:42.000
Yeah, I've had days like that.

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:45.330
Isn't there anything fun to do?

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:47.720
I'm busy right now.

00:08:00.070 --> 00:08:01.580
Ding-dong.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.460
Maniac!

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:10.460
