00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.340
Ding-dong!

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:16.970
Maniac!

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:18.530
Ding-dong!

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:19.780
Maniac!

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:20.400
Ding-dong!

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:21.730
Maniac!

