<i>Stare...</i>

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:46.220
Ding-dong!

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:47.790
Maniac!

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:47.850
Wh-What?
Maniac!

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:49.290
Wh-What?

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:51.300
<i>Stare...</i>

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.240
