00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.400
But I haven't prepared anything...

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.570
Nuh-uh.

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:10.650
This switch...

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:14.150
