00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:17.600
K-Karuta...

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:21.160
But I don't think I could like you more than I already...

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:23.910
Not enough. More.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:26.420
Karuta...

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:36.240
I-It hurts...

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:39.420
