00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:49.260
This is fun...

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:53.860
I am returned, my human chamberpots!

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:55.910
Kage-sama.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:59.950
