00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:01.020
Ding-dong. Ding-dong. Ding-dong!

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:03.270
Okay, cut it out already.
Ding-dong. Ding-dong. Ding-dong!

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:06.990
Cut it out. Okay, cut it out already!
Ding-dong. Ding-dong. Ding-dong!

00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:08.490
Oh-hoh, tee-hee~

00:11:08.490 --> 00:11:09.940
You two sure are having fun.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:11.560
Jealous?

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:13.400
No, not in the least.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.350
In fact, seeing boy-on-boy is revolting.

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:16.980
Die. Vanish from this Earth.

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:21.120
Aw, Nobara-chan. That's not nice!

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:30.810
What?

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:34.260
Ding-dong.

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:40.080
Ow-ow-ow-ow-ow...

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:43.160
Nobara-chan, it doesn't bend that way.

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:45.180
You're not supposed to bend it that way...

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:50.060
Besides, weren't you studying for an exam?

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:51.710
What are you doing here?

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:54.440
Huh? Just taking a break.

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:57.270
Quit goofing off and wasting time.

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:58.940
Go back to your room.

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:00.320
Hurry up!

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:02.320
Maniac!

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:03.470
Huh?

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:10.250
My betrothèd!

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:14.250
Hold still. Let me press this!

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:31.630
Inside the condo or not,
one is never safe from danger.

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:32.680
Right you are.

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:38.650
<i>It feels like everyone's been playing that game all day.</i>

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:40.050
<i>I wonder who started it.</i>

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:40.910
Ririchiyo-chan!
<i>I wonder who started it.</i>

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:41.730
<i>Yukinokouji-san already pokes me enough.
Ririchiyo-chan!</i>

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:44.000
<i>Yukinokouji-san already pokes me enough.</i>

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:00.250
Click.

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:10.760
That switch has a delayed reaction.

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:14.280
All in good time. Prepare yourself.

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.740
<i>I think I like it back here.</i>

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:54.290
This is my younger sister, Hana.

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:57.470
Our mother is busy today, so I brought her with me.

00:13:57.470 --> 00:14:00.530
Gosh, ain't she a cutie?

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:05.870
So you're babysitting her today? Mighty grown-up of you.

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:08.530
Not at all. It's my duty as her brother.

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:11.730
Here, girl. Here, girl. Here, girl.

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:13.580
She's not an animal.

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:15.980
She's quite adorable.

00:14:16.590 --> 00:14:18.740
Do you like children?

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:24.450
No. However, when I imagine you in your youth...

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:26.760
so sweet and adorable...

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:29.590
Please return to reality.

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.570
All right.

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:35.120
Let's play something together.

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:37.600
Hana-chan, what do you wanna play?

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:40.710
The big kids are going to play with us.

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:41.860
What do you want to do?

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:46.860
I-I wanna play house.

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:51.780
So what are the <i>dramatis personae?</i>

00:14:55.650 --> 00:14:57.800
Onii-chan is the daddy.

00:14:57.800 --> 00:14:59.780
So you're the mommy?

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:00.920
Little sister.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:02.750
"Little sister"...

00:15:05.140 --> 00:15:07.550
Hana wants to be your sister.

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:10.930
So she wants to be your sister no matter what, huh?

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.900
She certainly loves her brother.

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:17.680
So in this setting, the father lives
with his sister and extended family.

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:19.810
How is the family situation?

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:22.760
You don't have to go into that much detail.

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:26.350
Onee-chan, you're the mommy.

00:15:26.350 --> 00:15:27.440
M-Me?

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:30.350
Onii-chan, you're the grandpa.

00:15:32.100 --> 00:15:34.020
Onee-chan, you're the grandma.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:37.740
That leaves...

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:50.420
The Tagawa deliveryman.

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:56.030
I most humbly accept.

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:57.350
You most humbly do?!

00:15:58.100 --> 00:15:59.960
Well, it works.

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:01.730
Let's give it a shot.

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:10.740
I-I'm off to work.

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:14.240
H-Have a nice day.

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:20.710
<i>I-I've never played house before.</i>

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:22.420
<i>Is it supposed to go like this?</i>

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:24.330
Ririchiyo-san.

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:28.500
Is breakfast ready, deary?

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:33.000
O-Oh, right. Give me a moment.

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:39.430
Here's your breakfast.

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:48.190
<i>I've never played house before,
but I think I'm getting the hang of it.</i>

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:52.440
A mud dumpling.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:54.600
Feed us mud dumplings, will you?

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:56.640
You're a wicked housewife, you are.

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.860
Disrespecting your elders!

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:02.470
Disrespecting your elders!

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:07.720
Excuse me, I'm from Tagawa Delivery.

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:12.490
O-Okay, I'll be right there.

00:17:14.120 --> 00:17:16.890
You're a sorry excuse for a deliveryman.

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.300
I'm sorry, please excuse me.

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:21.480
I've come with a package for you.

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:26.140
If you could please sign here, ma'am.

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:30.500
Certainly...

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:39.530
I see you're not wearing your ring.

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:48.460
I know that things aren't going well with your husband.

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:51.620
N-No, hang on!

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:06.690
Ma'am, I've always had my eyes on you.

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:09.440
Wh-What is this, a soap opera?

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:10.940
G-Get off of me!

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:13.510
She's watching us!

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:15.820
Th-There's a child watching!

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:18.320
Isn't that more arousing?

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:20.010
Excuse me,

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:24.540
but I'd like to keep it kid-friendly.

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:28.590
Wanna take a break?

00:18:28.590 --> 00:18:30.790
L-Let's switch up the roles.

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:32.590
This time the mommy can be—

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:35.710
Loli! Maniac!

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:39.970
Tell me. From whence comes this loli?

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:44.440
Y-Yukinokouji-san, do
you want to play too?

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:46.430
Do I ever!

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.340
I-In that case,

00:18:49.340 --> 00:18:52.200
Roromiya-san is the grandma,

00:18:52.200 --> 00:18:57.320
Sorinozuka-san and Yukinokouji-san are the daddy and mommy...

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:59.490
Why am I married to <i>him?</i>

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:06.350
Um, Shirakiin-san is the older sister,
and Hana and I are her younger siblings.

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:07.990
F-Finally...

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:11.010
Miketsukami-san is the dog.

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:12.010
I understand.

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:13.710
You understand?!

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:17.050
Let's begin House: Round 2.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:26.010
'Kay, I'm off to work.

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.350
Where's my goodbye kiss?

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:34.770
Well,

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:36.650
I should have expected that.

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:41.160
Leave early, come home late,
and be the breadwinner. That's all I ask.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:43.030
Yeah, yeah.

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:45.250
I'm off then.

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:49.570
Nobara-san.

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:52.290
Oh my, Granny Karuta!

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:54.950
Is breakfast ready, deary?

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:59.510
Hungry girls! Maniac!

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:00.420
I see.

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:03.740
The family situation looks pretty tense.

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:04.920
Duly noted.

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:09.350
Um, I think you're overanalyzing...

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:12.190
My dear siblings, fear not.

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:16.460
Your sister will graduate and find a job so we can leave this place.

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:20.000
Don't worry. I'll make sure you can still go to school.

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:24.750
<i>Shirakiin-san takes things too seriously.</i>

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:26.200
Ririchiyo-sama.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:29.760
When you do, can I come with you?

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:32.420
The dog is talking!

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:39.210
Indeed, I am your dog. If you depart from this house, my life shall be empty.

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:42.090
Wait, should the dog be talking?

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:45.930
If we allow fantasy elements, it will be hard to keep the story under control.

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:49.850
Very well. Then we shall make it so that I do not speak.

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:53.770
This game of house is pretty strict on its rules.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:55.170
Kotarou-chan.

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:57.880
Is breakfast ready, deary?

00:20:57.880 --> 00:20:58.980
Uh...

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:05.740
I'm sorry, but most rented apartments do not allow large dogs.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:08.160
Whine... Whine...

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:10.410
Fret ye not!

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:13.250
'Tis I, my human chamberpots!

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:15.690
My sister is here.

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:19.090
Please don't say "h-human chamberpots"...

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:20.610
Younger brother, he's an intruder!

00:21:20.610 --> 00:21:21.630
Call 110!

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:22.790
Say hey!

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:24.380
Say, say, say, say, say!

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:28.530
For your information, I'm no intruder.

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:31.810
Furthermore, you need not lament your parents' marital disputes.

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:33.260
That's because...

00:21:37.550 --> 00:21:40.400
I'm your real father!

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:42.030
How lamentable.

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:45.380
Come with me, my offspring!

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:48.910
You'll enjoy three square meals and a nap each day with me!

00:21:49.650 --> 00:21:51.030
Three meals...

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:52.880
Three meals!

00:21:52.880 --> 00:21:55.290
Grandma, don't go!

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:58.420
'Tis cold!

00:21:58.870 --> 00:22:01.070
I'm <i>not</i> letting you have Grandmother.

00:22:01.070 --> 00:22:02.030
Dear!

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:05.940
It's finally begun!

00:22:05.940 --> 00:22:09.390
Mommy vs. Real Daddy!

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:11.450
You sure came out of nowhere.

00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:13.390
Where are we anyway?

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:15.650
They're staring each other down!

00:22:15.650 --> 00:22:18.650
I've brought a toy for you today.

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:21.540
Why don't you marry that toy?

00:22:21.540 --> 00:22:25.150
Ooh, sparks are flying!

00:22:25.650 --> 00:22:27.280
Ready... fight!

00:22:35.370 --> 00:22:39.970
And an enormous chunk of
ice is floating over Mommy!

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:40.630
Huh?

00:22:43.770 --> 00:22:45.610
Winner: Mommy!

00:22:45.610 --> 00:22:46.580
That's domestic violence.

00:22:46.580 --> 00:22:48.220
Indeed it is.

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:50.640
I'm home.

00:22:51.690 --> 00:22:53.220
Man, I'm beat—

00:22:56.620 --> 00:22:59.730
What... is going...

00:23:02.500 --> 00:23:05.650
The real father lies collapsed on the ground.

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:09.500
Can the mother ever repent for her sins?

00:23:09.500 --> 00:23:12.880
Who is the <i>real</i> father of the children?

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:28.640
I trained real hard today!

00:23:28.640 --> 00:23:30.940
I'll be a super delinquent now!

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:33.780
Watanuki-san.

00:23:33.780 --> 00:23:36.450
Is breakfast ready, deary?
